Writes the document your brief names to the corpus. Code adds its kind, category, sub-category and scope from the topic, and checks the corpus contract all at once, naming every problem; nothing is written until it all passes. Each section is a `##` heading and its text: the heading descriptive enough to make sense alone in a search result, the text self-contained, 1,000 to 2,000 characters. `knowledge_kind: implementation` needs `applies_to`, and `applies_to` needs `verified_on`. Writing again replaces the file and keeps the earlier version as a record.
